    "background_story": "Kaleb was a young archaeologist with an unquenchable thirst for uncovering the secrets of ancient mythology. Growing up, he was fascinated by the stories of his ancestors, who claimed to be descended from the great heroes of old. As he delved deeper into his research, Kaleb became obsessed with the legend of the Phoenix, said to possess the power of rebirth and regeneration. He spent years searching for the fabled temple where the Phoenix was said to reside, finally stumbling upon it hidden deep within the Egyptian desert. There, he discovered an ancient text that revealed the Phoenix to be more than just a myth - it was a guardian of ancient knowledge, waiting for a worthy successor to unlock its secrets. Kaleb's discovery sent shockwaves through the academic community, cementing his reputation as a leading expert in the field of mythology.",
